
>> shop := (Dizzjunarju ġdid
	poġġi: ['magazine'] fi: ['books'],
	poġġi: ['computer'] fi: ['electronics'],
	poġġi: ['lipstick'] fi: ['cosmetics']
).
Ħruġ ikteb: (shop għandu: ['computer']), linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: (shop għandu: ['sausage']), linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: (shop għandu: ['computers']), linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: (shop għandu: ['compute']), linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: (shop għandu: ['2computer']), linja-ġdida. 
